# Copy to .env.dev, .env.uat or .env.local. Never commit the copy (gitignored).
#
# The TEST user the signed-in specs (appTest, api) use. Password sign-in goes
# through the web's own form, like a person. dev and uat share the fintary-dev
# Firebase Auth pool, so one user can work on both (it needs rows in each database).
#
# Use a test account, never your own login, and never copy from
# the app repo's production env files.
E2E_EMAIL=
E2E_PASSWORD=

# The account (str_id) the app opens on: the app's own localStorage selectedAccount.
# Use an "E2E Test account..." one for anything that writes. Empty = the user's default.
# E2E_ACCOUNT_ID=

# local only, instead of a password: sign in as an existing fintary-dev uid through the
# repo's SKILLS/run-app/scripts/sign-in.mts (custom token, your gcloud ADC), or with
# E2E_EMULATOR=1 through emulator-sign-in.mts (auth emulator :4002, offline).
# E2E_UID=
# E2E_EMULATOR=1

# Optional overrides (defaults: config/environments.json)
# E2E_WEB_URL=
# E2E_API_URL=
